## Crash Recovery & Time-Travel

```typescript
// Resume from last checkpoint after failure
const state = await graph.getState({
  configurable: { threadId: "analysis-abc-123" },
});
const result = await graph.invoke(null, {
  configurable: { threadId: "analysis-abc-123" },
});

// List checkpoint history
const history = await graph.getStateHistory({
  configurable: { threadId: "analysis-abc-123" },
});

// Replay from specific checkpoint
await graph.invoke(null, {
  configurable: {
    threadId: "...",
    checkpointId: "...",
  },
});
```

